    "recommendations": "Confirming address numbering is clearly visible from the access road and street frontage could significantly improve responder navigation, particularly given the length of the driveway and single point of entry. Ensuring the driveway and internal drive aisle remain clear of parked vehicles and obstructions would support apparatus maneuvering and positioning near the main building. Identifying and communicating any secondary access options through the perimeter fencing to responding units in advance may assist when the primary access point is restricted. The open green space and pool area could serve as effective staging zones, and sharing that information with the local fire department through a pre-incident plan would support operational coordination during an emergency response."
